em\">Dear Dr. Dean,</p><p style=\"border:0px solid rgb(227,227,227);margin:1.25em 0px 0.5rem\">My name is Jayme Massim, and I am from Brazil. I have recently completed my PhD in Ecology and Evolution, focusing on the ecomorphology and macroevolution of the skull in neotropical pit vipers (Bothrops) using primarily 2D and 3D geometric morphometrics. We met in the course you taught in Barcelona. <span style=\"font-size:1rem\">I am very interested  and believe my background aligns well with the requirements.</span></p><p style=\"border:0px solid rgb(227,227,227);margin:1.25em 0px 0.5rem\">Thank you for the attention<span style=\"font-size:1rem\">.</span></p><p style=\"border:0px solid rgb(227,227,227);margin:1.25em 0px 0.5rem\">Best regards,<br style=\"border:0px solid rgb(227,227,227)\">Jayme Massim</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><br>\r\n<br><div class=\"gmail_quote\" dir=\"auto\"></div></div>"
